{
  "id": "GEN.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Kub 31",
  "verseCount": 55,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo naarugaho Labbani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, Yakobbo akahurra ngu batabani ba Labbani nibagamba bati: “Yakobbo atwaire ebintu bya Isiitwe byona, hati nibyo bimuguudahaize biti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo na uwe yarora Labbani atakyamugonza nka ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo MUKAMA yagambira Yakobbo ati: “Garuka omunsi eya baaswenkuru, omu bantu ab'oruganda rwawe, ndaikaraga na iwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yakobbo yatuma beete Rakeeri na Leeya, baije nambere akaba naaliisiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabagambira ati: “Hati, nyowe nindora isiinywe takyangonza nkooku yangonzaaga kara, baitu Ruhanga owa isenyowe tandugireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inywe nimumanya nkooku nkoliire isiinywe n'amaani gange goona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noobu ndaaba nakozire nti, isiinywe akangobeza, empeera yange yakagihiingisa emirundi ikumi, baitu Ruhanga atamwikirize kunkora kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu yagambaga ati: ‘Entaama ibamba rundi embuzi kitanga niyo ebe mpeera yawe,’ obu igana lyona lizaara ibamba n'ebitanga; kandi obu yagambaga ati: ‘Entaama ibamba rundi embuzi ez'ebigabu niyo ebe mpeera yaawe,’ lizaara ibamba n'ebigabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga nukwo yaihireho isiinywe ati amagana ge, yagaha nyowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi igana aka lyayemeramuga, naimukyaga amaiso ndora embuzi empaya ezaatembaga igana, zaabaga ruyenje, rugabu, rutanga na rugondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho malaika wa Ruhanga yanyeta ati: ‘Yakobbo,’ namwetebuka nti: ‘MUKAMA wange’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yangamba ati: ‘Imukya amaiso orole, empaya zoona ezirukutemba igana, z'ebigabu, ruyenje, rutanga na rugondo, habwokuba nyetegeriize byona Labbani ebi arukukukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19+GEN.28.20+GEN.28.21+GEN.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyowe Ruhanga ayakubonekiire oli Beesweri nambere waseesiireho ibaale amagita kandi wandahira. Hati, imuka oruge omunsi enu ogaruke omunsi ei wazairwemu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Rakeeri na Leeya baamukagwize bati: “Omunju ya isiitwe tukyainamu omugabo rundi obugwetwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarukutusisaniza nk'abanyamahanga? Ngira akatutunda, abaire naayekonyeza sente ezi yatwihiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu byona Ruhanga ebi aihireho isiitwe, bifookere byaitu n'abaana baitu; kyona Ruhanga eki akuragiire okikole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yakobbo yaimuka, yatembya ha ngamiya, batabani be na bakazi be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yafunya ente ze zoona, n'ebitungwa bye byona ebi akaba atungiire Padanaramu, yagenda omunsi Kanaani omba Isaaka ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labbani obu akaba agenzire kusara ebyoya by'entaama ze, Rakeeri yaiba ebisisani eby'embandwa za ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yagobeza Labbani, omuramani tiyamumanyisa nkooku amaliriire kumurugaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairuka n'ebintu bye byona ebi akaba anyinabyo, yayambuka ekisaaru Efuraate, yagenda aroleriire Giryadi ensi ey'ensozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya kasatu, Labbani obu baamugambiire Yakobbo nkooku airukire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yayeta ab'oruganda rwe, yamuhondera, yamara ebiro musanju atakamuhikireho, yagenda namwiriirra, okuhika Giryadi ensi ey'ensozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omu bwire obw'ekiro, Ruhanga akaroosa Labbani Omwaramani yamugambira ati: “Oyerinde, otagamba Yakobbo ekigambo, noobu kiraaba kirungi rundi kibi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo naakora endagaano na Labbani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labbani yahikaho Yakobbo. Omu kasumi ako, Yakobbo akaba atiire eheema omunsi ey'ensozi, Labbani n'ab'oruganda rwe, na uwe yateera orukande rwe Giryadi ensi ey'ensozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labbani yakaguza Yakobbo ati: “Okakora kintu ki kungobeza okatwara bahara bange n'abaana bange, nk'abahambirwe omu bulemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiki ekyakwirukize otamanyirwe, ekyakuleeteriize kungobeza, walema kungambira, nukwo nkakusendekereza n'omuhimbo n'ebizina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kiki otaranyikiriize nkanywegera batabani bange na bahara bange nkabaraga? Okakora eky'obudoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsobora kukukora kubi, baitu Ruhanga wa sso angambiirege ekiro ati: ‘Oyerinde, otagamba Yakobbo ekigambo na kimu, noobu kiraaba kirungi rundi kibi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati ondugireho wagenda, habwokuba oina ekihika kingi eky'eka ya sso, baitu kiki ekyakwibisize embandwa zange?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yagarukamu Labbani ati: “Nkatiina, habwokuba nkateekereza nti: Bahara bawe noija kubaanyagaho n'empaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu weena ou oraasanga anyina embandwa zaawe, araitwa. Nyoleka ekintu kyawe eki nyinakyo, omumaiso ga batabani baitu banu, hanyuma okitwale.” Baitu Yakobbo akaba atamanyire Rakeeri nkooku aibire embandwa za ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Labbani yaserra omu heema ya Yakobbo, eya Leeya, n'omu heema ey'abazaana ababiri, baitu embandwa ze tiyazisangamu. Yaruga omu heema eya Leeya, yataaha omu ya Rakeeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeeri ebisisani by'embandwa z'eka ya ise akaba abitaire omu bisago by'engamiya, abiikaliire. Labbani obu yaserwire hoona hoona omu heema, atabisangemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeeri yagambira ise ati: “Mukama wange, oleke kumbiihirirwa habw'okutakwimukira, habwokuba ndi omu ngeso y'abakazi.” Labbani noobu yaserwire, atazoole mbandwa z'eka ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yakwatwa ekiniga, yajumbuutukira Labbani naagamba ati: “Eki nasobeze, kiri nkaha rundi kibi ki eki nakozire, eki wasigikiireho kumpondera? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu otindwire omu bintu byange byona, osangiremu kintu ki? Kite hanu, omumaiso ag'ab'oruganda rwange n'ab'oruganda rwawe, nubo batucweremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmazire na iwe emyaka makumi abiri, entaama zawe n'embuzi zawe ebuguma tizikatoroogaga, kandi tinkalyaga ntaama mpaya ey'omu igana lyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi eyaitwaga enyamaiswa, nkaba ntakagikuleeteraga, ninyowe nagirehaga; egi eyabaga ibirwe nyamusana, rundi ekiro wagindehesaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo naikaire na iwe nti; nyamusana, omusana gwanyokyaga, ekiro obutiti burarra kunyita, mburwa oturo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka makumi abiri, nkagimara omunju yawe, nkakukorra emirimo okumara emyaka ikumi n'ena, nukwo nswere bahara bawe ababiri, kandi emyaka mukaaga, nkagimara nindiisa amagana gawe, omu kasumi ako koona, empeera yange okagihingisa emirundi ikumi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kakuba Ruhanga wa isenyowe Abburahamu, Ruhanga, Isaaka ou atiina, ataranyemereho, mananukwo waakubaire ombingire ntaina kantu, Ruhanga akarora omutima gwange, n'omulimo nakukoliire, nikyo akuhaniirege ekiro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labbani yagarukamu Yakobbo ati: “Abaisiki abo bahara bange, abaana abo bange, amagana ago ag'entaama n'ag'embuzi, gange, na byona ebi orukurora ebi, byange, hati bahara bange rundi abaana baabo aba baazaire mbakole ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe na nyowe tukole endagaano, niyo ebe bwakaiso hagati yawe na nyowe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yakwata ibaale, yalisimba libe kiijukyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yagamba ab'oruganda rwe ati: “Musorooze amabaale.” Baagasorooza, yagatuuma entuumo, baalya ebyokulya baikaliire ha ntuumo ey'amabaale ago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entuumo ey'amabaale egi, Labbani yagiruka ibara Yegara-Sahadusa, baitu Yakobbo, uwe yagyeta Galeedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labbani yagamba ati: “Okuruga hati, entuumo ey'amabaale enu, niyo eraabaga bwakaiso bwaitu.” Entuumo ey'amabaale egi, yagyeta Galeedi kandi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibaale yalyeta Mizipa, habwokuba akagamba ati: “MUKAMA abege mulinzi waitu, obu turaabaga tutali hanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahara bange obu olibakora kubi, rundi okabongeraho abakazi abandi, hati noobu haraaba hataroho muntu ondi, oijuke MUKAMA nuwe kaiso wawe kandi kaiso wange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Labbani yagambira Yakobbo ati: “Dora entuumo ey'amabaale enu, n'ibaale linu, ebi nata hagati yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entuumo enu bwakaiso, ibaale, nalyo bwakaiso oburukugumya nkooku otaliguruka entuumo enu, n'ibaale linu erisimbirwe, kandi nanyowe tindibiguruka tukakorangana akabi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ow'Abburahamu, Ruhanga owa Nahooli kandi Ruhanga ogu, Isaaka ise ou yatamuga ekitiinisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yatamba ekyonzira ha rusozi oru yayeta ab'oruganda rwe, baalya ebyokulya, baaraara ha rusozi oru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyenkya kara omu rukyakya, Labbani yaimuka, yanywegera abaijukuru n'abahara, yabaha omugisa, yakwata omuhanda, yagaruka owaabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
